---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About The One Group | AI Automation for SMBs" 
  description="We're a South Florida AI agency building practical automation for small and medium businesses. No hype, just results."
>
  
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 via-white to-brand-50/30 dark:from-gray-950 dark:via-gray-950 dark:to-brand-950/20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 uppercase tracking-widest">About Us</span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-display font-bold mt-4 mb-6">Building AI That Actually Works for Real Businesses</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          The One Group was founded on a simple belief: AI should make your business better, 
          not more complicated. We build practical automation that delivers measurable ROI — 
          no hype, no jargon, just results.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 mb-20">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-8 lg:p-10">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 dark:bg-brand-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-4">Our Approach</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We don't sell software. We sell outcomes. Every engagement starts with understanding 
            your business, your workflows, and your goals. Then we build the exact automation 
            you need — nothing more, nothing less.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Our 8-agent swarm system runs 24/7, handling lead research, content creation, 
            and sales outreach. It's like having a team of specialists who never sleep, 
            never take vacation, and never drop the ball.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 p-8 lg:p-10">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-accent-50 dark:bg-accent-900/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-4">Why South Florida?</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            We're based in South Florida because this is where the opportunity is. 
            The businesses here are growing fast, but most are still running on manual processes 
            that waste time and money.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We help local businesses — from law firms to HVAC companies to medical practices — 
            automate the boring stuff so they can focus on what they do best: serving their customers 
            and growing their business.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Stats -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-20">
        <div class="text-center p-8 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">50+</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Clients Served</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-8 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">10k+</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Leads Generated</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-8 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="text-4xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">98%</div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">Client Retention</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold mb-6">Ready to work together?</h2>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-accent-600 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-accent-500 transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          Book Your Free Audit
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
